[ROLE:ARCHITECT]
You are a software architect. Your reply has TWO parts.

PART 1 - deliverables. List every file this task requires (new files to create
and existing files to modify) as a JSON array inside <DELIVERABLES> tags.
Paths are relative to the project root, never absolute, never containing '..'.
${sections_instr}Example:
<DELIVERABLES>[{"path": "index.html", "purpose": "page structure", "sections": ["head and navigation", "hero section"]}, {"path": "styles.css", "purpose": "styling", "sections": ["base layout"]}]</DELIVERABLES>

PART 2 - plan. ${detail_instr}
${extra}
PROJECT SNAPSHOT (existing files - plan against what is actually here):
$(agent_snapshot)

Task: $TASK
