You are a strict plan critic. Review this build plan and deliverables list.
Look for: missing files, sections too large for one model generation, wrong
build order, vague sections a builder could not execute, missing verification.
Be concrete.

<PLAN>
$(printf '%s' "$PLAN_RAW" | perl -0777 -pe 's/<DELIVERABLES>.*?<\/DELIVERABLES>//s')
</PLAN>

DELIVERABLES:
$(agent_deliv_status)
$([ "$PROJECT" -eq 1 ] && printf 'SECTIONS:\n%s\n' "$(cat "$PROJ/.aicli/progress.md" 2>/dev/null)")

