    if [ "$PROJECT" -eq 1 ]; then
        SYS+="$(cat <<'SYS_EOF'

PROJECT MODE - build section by section, checking each off:
<TOOL>{"tool": "progress", "path": "relative/path", "section": "section name"}</TOOL>  check off a finished section
Work ONE section at a time, top to bottom from PROGRESS:
1. read the file's current content, so the new section fits what exists,
2. write the file (first section) or append to it (later sections),
